# From the first of three matches, shift+F3 has nothing before it and goes round
# to the last: "two" at the end of "one two one two one two" is columns 21 to 23.
# (Going forward instead would land on the second, so this tells them apart.)
# files t.txt=one two one two one two
# open t.txt
# frames 10
# expect selection two
# expect cursor 1 24
1 key f ctrl
2 text two
3 key esc
4 key f3 shift
